m-mdy-m-log — third-party attribution and project lineage

This repository is a redesigned and extended logging library for the m-mdy-m/log.c repository.
The predecessor repository https://github.com/m-mdy-m/log.c is publicly identified as a fork
of https://github.com/rxi/log.c. The minimal logging-library design and project lineage are
attributed to that upstream work.

